.SH NAME
tagents-send - Send a message to an agent


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtagents send   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Send a message to an agent as if typed + Enter in its tmux pane.

.PP
Agent name is fuzzy-matched. If the agent is busy, asks for confirmation unless --force is given.

.PP
Examples:
  tagents send my-agent "please continue"
  tagents send my-agent "what is the status?" --force
  tagents send gateway:worker "stop and report"


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-f\fP, \fB--force\fP[=false]
	Send even if agent is busy

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for send


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--all-machines\fP[=false]
